I'll have some time available on an ongoing basis over the next six months or so to do some Stan-related projects.  One of the things I'm interested in is the input/output (reader/writer?) refactor but it's hard to figure out where the different pieces of it are at and how to contribute.  I've already looked over the code under (https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/pull/1546) so I get what the overall goal is.  Any suggestions about what the needs are for that branch at the moment?

